<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/41/eng@/~cl_4> <https://schema.org/text> "48A. 48 the following new section 48A: \"Fire 48A. (1) There shall be established a Fire Services Services Department Welfare Fund Committee which shall Department Welfare have the control of the Fund. Fund Committee. (2) The Committee shall consist of following members: (a) the Director-General as Chairman; (b) two Senior Fire Officers to be appointed by the Minister; and (c) two public officers to be appointed by the Minister. (3) No meeting of the Committee shall be held in the absence of the Director-General. (4) The quorum for meetings of the Committee shall be three, (5) Subject to this Act, the Committee shall have power to regulate its proceedings.\"."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/41/eng@> .
